il-grossglockner-alpine-hike-austria/","https://charlieswanderings.com/austria/hiking-to-margaritzenstausee-and-pasterze-glacier-from-the-glocknerhaus/","https://www.grossglockner.at/en/nature-experience-grossglockner/hiking","https://www.moonhoneytravel.com/grossglockner-high-alpine-road-austria/","https://kalitodd.com/grossglockner/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Take the cobbled spur up to the Edelweissspitze","type":"activity","detail":"A rough branch of about 1.5 km leaves Fuscher Toerl for the highest point on the road at 2571 m, with a full circle of peaks.","season":[5,6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":27,"urls":["https://www.salzburg.info/en/sights/excursions/grossglockner-high-alpine-road","https://www.moonhoneytravel.com/grossglockner-high-alpine-road-austria/","https://www.salzburg-trip.com/guides/grossglockner-high-alpine-road/","https://www.motorcyclebooking.com/famous-passes/21","https://vacaywork.com/grossglockner-high-alpine-road-salzburg-daytrip/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Glocknerkoenig hill climb","type":"festival","detail":"One June morning the road shuts to cars while riders race 29 km up to the Edelweissspitze on ramps of up to twelve percent.","season":[6],"link":"https://www.glocknerkoenig.com/en/general-information","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":27,"urls":["https://www.glocknerkoenig.com/en/general-information","https://www.cycling-challenge.com/grossglockner-glocknerkonig-bike-day/","https://www.grossglockner.at/en/event/glocknerkoenig_e332","https://www.roadbike-holidays.com/en/road-bike-events/events-detail/glockner-king","https://www.granfondoguide.com/Events/Index/7150/the-glocknerk%C3%B6nig"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Hike the Gamsgrubenweg tunnels","type":"trail","detail":"A level gallery path cut through rock tunnels runs from the top car park into the reserve, about two hours facing the glacier.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":27,"urls":["https://www.g